	"data": "Vault Vocabulary × Nanolucent — Sovereignty Through Naming\n\nThe Two Concepts\n\nVault Vocabulary (concepts/vault-vocabulary.md): A formal RDF vocabulary that maps the vault's prose predicates (implements, extends, connects-to) to standard and custom RDF predicates. When Dublin Core or SKOS don't capture the relationship you mean, you mint vault:implements — a custom predicate with a precise definition that fits your knowledge graph.\n\nNanolucent (concepts/nanolucent.md): A spatial unit based on…",
